  "description": "Kittia is a young but brave kitty who wants to avenge her mom’s wrongful death. But with no one left to rely on, she seeks help from the powerful Gritwolfs by pretending to be an orphaned wolf pup. To her relief, they completely fall for her act... Well, they fall for her cuteness anyway. Despite realizing Kittia is a cat at first sniff, the Gritwolfs decide to take her in as the family’s youngest daughter. Totally oblivious to the fact that she has already been found out, Kittia will try her best to be the most convincing wolf ever...!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
